  "question": {
    "text": "The number of ways, in which&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;girls and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;boys can be seated at a round&nbsp;&nbsp;table so that no two girls sit together is",
